# Exceptions for tools/kit-check: one `path<TAB>string` per line, separated by a single tab.
# A hit in `path` passes only when an occurrence of `string` in the same line covers the matched text.
# For commit metadata, `path` is `@ident` or `@message`. Keep every entry exact; never allow a bare name.
# The repository's own URL has to appear where the kit tells people how to install it.
